🎄
"Christmas"/en"圣诞节"/zh-CN"聖誕節"/zh-TW
===
¶A Christmas tree that wobbles and shimmies in a looping dance, and jingles while
it does.

The tune hangs on the dance's first @Pose. A @Pose can carry a @Music, and it
plays the moment that pose is struck — so the phrase begins again every time the
dance comes round, and the loop of the animation and the loop of the music are
the same loop. Nothing counts beats to keep them together.

The two lengths are chosen to match: eight beats at 160 is three seconds, and
five half-second steps take three seconds too. A pose is an instant rather than
something that lasts, so a @Track's usual looping doesn't apply here — a pose's
music always plays through exactly once.¶

jingle: 🎼(
	🎶([3 3 3𝅗𝅥 3 3 3𝅗𝅥] instrument: 🔈.🔔)
	tempo: 160beats/min
	volume: 55%
	name: 'jingle'
)

Phrase('🎄' resting: Sequence({
	0: Pose(rotation: 0° music: jingle)
	1: Pose(rotation: 15°)
	2: Pose(rotation: 0°)
	3: Pose(offset: Place(-0.25m))
	4: Pose(offset: Place(0.25m))
	5: Pose(offset: Place(-0.25m))} 0.6s))
